    *> ORDER VALUE
    05 WS-ORDV            PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> SERVICE S=STANDARD E=EXPRESS O=OVERNIGHT
    05 WS-SVC             PIC X.
       88 SVC-STANDARD VALUE 'S'.
    *> DESTINATION ZONE CODE
    05 WS-ZONE            PIC X(2).
       88 ZONE-Z7-OR-ZR VALUES 'Z7' 'ZR'.
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
